## Configuration & Code Changes

### 1. `app/metric_emitter.py` (Metrics Route Fix)

```python
@app.route("/health")
def health():
    return jsonify({"status": "ok"}), 200


@app.route("/metrics")
def metrics():
    return generate_latest(REGISTRY), 200, {"Content-Type": CONTENT_TYPE_LATEST}


if __name__ == "__main__":
    threading.Thread(target=_nudge_metrics, daemon=True).start()
    app.run(host="0.0.0.0", port=5000)
```

### 2. `prometheus.yml` (Scrape Target Port Fix)

```yaml
global:
  scrape_interval: 5s
  evaluation_interval: 5s

scrape_configs:
  - job_name: metric-emitter
    static_configs:
      - targets:
          - metric-emitter:5000
```

### 3. `grafana/provisioning/datasources/prometheus.yml` (Datasource Port Fix)

```yaml
apiVersion: 1

datasources:
  - name: Prometheus
    type: prometheus
    access: proxy
    url: http://prometheus:9090
    isDefault: true
    editable: true
```

