## Remediation & Reload Commands

```bash
cd /root/code/monitoring/

# 1. Patch Flask exporter metrics route
sed -i 's|@app.route("/prom-metrics")|@app.route("/metrics")|' app/metric_emitter.py

# 2. Patch Prometheus scrape target port
sed -i 's|metric-emitter:8000|metric-emitter:5000|' prometheus.yml

# 3. Patch Grafana provisioned Prometheus datasource port
sed -i 's|http://prometheus:9091|http://prometheus:9090|' grafana/provisioning/datasources/prometheus.yml

# 4. Reload affected services
docker compose up -d --force-recreate metric-emitter prometheus grafana
```

